flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[/Read farmer entry/]
    B --> C{Numeric values valid?}
    C -- No --> D[Show input error]
    D --> B
    C -- Yes --> E{Litres > 0 and fat in 2.0..7.0?}
    E -- No --> F[Reject entry]
    F --> B
    E -- Yes --> G[Calculate rate and payment]
    G --> H[Add payment to ten-day total]
    H --> I{More entries?}
    I -- Yes --> B
    I -- No --> J[Display total]
    J --> K([End])
